<title>UK: BHF Bank sets 100 million mark Dax-linked bond.</title>
<headline>BHF Bank sets 100 million mark Dax-linked bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager BHF-Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BHF-BANK</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON     ZERO	MATURITY   *20.DEC.02</p>
<p> TYPE	DAX-LINKED ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    09.MAY.97</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    FRANKFURT PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> NOTES    *REDEMPTION WILL BE AT A RATE OF EITHER 14,400 DEM PER</p>
<p>	     10,000 DEM BOND, OR AN AMOUNT LINKED TO THE DAX INDEX</p>
<p>	     UNSUBORDINATED</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
